            "text_position": "center",
            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Trusted Grass Seed Supplier Serving Carbondale for Over 35 Years",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Having trouble with patchy lawns, dry pastures, or shady spots where nothing grows? Our grass seed mixes are made for Carbondale’s climate. From cool season blends to <a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Native+Grass\" target=\"_blank\">native mixes</a> for erosion control, <a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pasture+Grass\" target=\"_blank\">pasture seed</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\">turf grass</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Wildflowers+%26+Grass+Seed\" target=\"_blank\">wildflowers</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Grass\" target=\"_blank\">all-purpose lawn mixes</a>, we’ve got options that work.</p><p>At Rivendell Distribution, you’ll find bulk seed for big jobs, small bags for home use, and mixes for sun, shade, or dry soil. If you need grass seed that holds up in Colorado’s changing weather, we’re here to help.</p>",
            "text_size": 100,
            "button_text": "",
